==Other Appearances==
==={{AoC|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
{{Descriptions AoC}}
The Barbarian Armor is a piece of [[Attire]] that can only be worn by [[Link]], and it is obtained by completing the [[Challenge]] "[[Coliseum: Expert]]". It can also be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

====Dye Options====
{{Dye|AoC|Barbarian Armor}}
{{Noncanon|End}}

==Trivia==
* As with other [[Barbarian Set]] pieces, upgrading Barbarian Armor to level ★★ reduces its [[Sell Price]] by 60 [[Rupee]]s. Level ★★★ Barbarian Armors sell for the same price as level ★ Barbarian Armors. No other [[Enhancing|Enhancement]]s in the game decrease the Armor's Sell Price.

